===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[new|New]] [[York]] [[city|City]]}}

# '''New York City''' is the largest city in the [[United States of America]]. It consists of five [[boroughs]]: [[Manhattan]], the [[Bronx]], [[Brooklyn]], [[Queens]], and [[Staten Island]]. The city is situated on the [[Atlantic Ocean|Atlantic Coast]] at the mouth of the [[Hudson River]] in the northeastern [[New York State|state of New York]].
#: ''Lagos and '''New York City''' are both the largest cities in their respective countries.''
# [[Manhattan]].

====Usage notes====
'''New York City''' may alone refer to the one borough or island of Manhattan but usually refers to the entire city spanning all five boroughs. The city’s official name is '''New York''' but is commonly referred to as '''New York City (NYC)'''; the '''City of New York'''; or '''New York, New York (NY, NY)''', in order to distinguish it from New York State.

